      "title": [
        "flaska, korg, bottle"
      ],
      "dcDescription": [
        "1927.04.0021 skiss Pa/iute. stabil Amerika United States Paiutes Paiute People This bottle is made of plant fibers and is completely watertight. It was manufactured in the western US, and belonged to the Native American Paiute tribe, some of whom live near Pyramid Lake, in Nevada. According to legend, sometimes the sound of crying children is heard coming from the lake. It tempts people down into the water, where they drown due to strong underwater currents. Yet without these spirits, there would be no water. People must show the water the proper respect. Vattentät korgflaska.\nGåva.\nInköpt gen"
      ],
